# Famished Worldsire devours one land (a 3/3) and its enters trigger goes on the stack; Bot2 answers with a Lightning Bolt, its
# ward {3} paid, and the Worldsire dies. X is the power it had as it last existed on the battlefield (CR 608.2h): 3, so Bot1
# looks at three cards (a Lightning Bolt it may not take, a Forest and a Swamp) and puts both lands onto the battlefield tapped;
# the Grizzly Bears below them is not among them.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Famished Worldsire
Forest
Island
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Swamp
Grizzly Bears
Mountain
Plains x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Island x20

